    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Build",
      "items": [
        "src/features/* (slices) · src/platform/* · src/shared/* · src/gen/api",
        "one image, two entrypoints: bin/api.ts + bin/worker.ts — stateless, PM2 or Kubernetes",
        "the eslint drop-in at lints/eslint.config.mjs encodes the import law: domain I/O-free, slices never import slices"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Run",
      "items": [
        "durable side effects ride the BullMQ outbox worker — the DB outbox row, not the Redis job, is the durability boundary",
        "migrations via drizzle-kit are a deploy step you control — never at server startup",
        "readyz runs SELECT 1 through the PgBouncer-sized pool and gates every deploy; config is zod-parsed once at boot, fails closed"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Quality gates",
      "items": [
        "make ci: tsc --noEmit + eslint + vitest — a broken architecture contract is an automatic must fix in review",
        "table-driven vitest: fake ports instead of real Redis/Postgres, no wall clock",
        "auth ships: bcrypt over an HMAC-SHA256 pepper pre-hash · JWT 15m · rotating refresh 720h · audit logs"
      ]
    }
